idually using the talk test. Keep the same pace for weeks 1–2; if tolerated, extend by up to 5 min in weeks 3–4 after coach review. Use handrails only for getting on/off safely.","client_note_ar":"اختر سرعة مشي أو هرولة خفيفة مناسبة للفرد باستخدام اختبار الكلام. ثبّت الوتيرة أول أسبوعين؛ يمكن إضافة حتى ٥ دقائق في الأسبوعين الثالث والرابع بعد مراجعة المدرب.","intervals":"Continuous steady movement","cardio":{"method":"treadmill","intensity":"miss","duration":"30 min","frequency_per_week":3,"speed":"Adjust speed: can talk, but not sing","incline_resistance":"0–3% incline; lower if needed","distance_target":"","step_target":"","recovery":"Easy day between sessions"}}],"cooldown":[{"exercise_id":"lib_cool_01","prescription":"5 min easy","notes":"Reduce pace gradually; follow the coach’s assigned recovery."}]}]},{"id":"panda_cardio_rowing_steady","name":"04 · Rowing Rhythm","name_ar":"٠٤ · إيقاع التجديف","description":"Moderate rowing with controlled rhythm and planned recovery.","description_ar":"تجديف متوسط بإيقاع منضبط وراحة مخططة.","notes":"Coach template: review suitability and adjust the targets before assignment. Three controlled six-minute blocks with two minutes easy between blocks (22 min main session). The stroke-rate range is a starting cue, not a speed requirement. Reduce it if technique changes; keep conversational effort.","notes_ar":"نموذج للمدرب: راجع الملاءمة وعدّل الأهداف قبل التخصيص. ثلاث فترات مدة كل منها ٦ دقائق مع دقيقتين خفيفتين بين الفترات (٢٢ دقيقة أساسية). معدل الضربات نقطة بداية وليس شرط سرعة؛ خفّضه إذا تغيرت التقنية وحافظ على جهد يسمح بالكلام.","plan_type":"cardio","weeks":4,"status":"published","version":1,"versions":[],"origin":"Panda Cardio HQ template · 0.9.15","sessions":[{"name":"04 · Rowing Rhythm","name_ar":"٠٤ · إيقاع التجديف","day":"Tue / Sat","focus":"Moderate rowing with controlled rhythm and planned recovery.","focus_ar":"تجديف متوسط بإيقاع منضبط وراحة مخططة.","warmup":[{"exercise_id":"lib_warm_01","prescription":"5 min easy","notes":"Use the main-session activity at an easy pace."}],"exercises":[{"exercise_id":"ex_24c6ae97f18c","sets":1,"reps":"As prescribed","rest":0,"load":"","notes":"Three controlled six-minute blocks with two minutes easy between blocks (22 min main session). The stroke-rate range is a starting cue, not a speed requirement. Reduce it if technique changes; keep conversational effort.","client_note_ar":"ثلاث فترات مدة كل منها ٦ دقائق مع دقيقتين خفيفتين بين الفترات (٢٢ دقيقة أساسية). معدل الضربات نقطة بداية وليس شرط سرعة؛ خفّضه إذا تغيرت التقنية وحافظ على جهد يسمح بالكلام.","intervals":"3 × 6 min steady / 2 min easy; no extra recovery after the final block","cardio":{"method":"rowing_machine","intensity":"miss","duration":"3 × 6 min work","frequency_per_week":2,"speed":"18–22 strokes / min; smooth technique","incline_resistance":"Comfortable resistance; technique first","distance_target":"","step_target":"","recovery":"2 min easy rowing between blocks; easy day between sessions"}}],"cooldown":[{"exercise_id":"lib_cool_01","prescription":"5 min easy","notes":"Reduce pace gradually; follow the coach’s assigned recovery."}]}]},{"id":"panda_cardio_bike_intervals","name":"05 · Bike Intervals","name_ar":"٠٥ · فواصل الدراجة","description":"One controlled interval session weekly for experienced cardio clients.","description_ar":"جلسة فواصل منضبطة أسبوعياً للمتمرسين في الكارديو.","notes":"Coach template: review suitability and adjust the targets before assignment. Complete 6 rounds of 1 min hard / 2 min easy (18 min main block), with 5–8 min easy warm-up and 5 min cool-down. Reserve for clients with an established aerobic base. Begin with 4 rounds if the coach chooses; never progress pace and rounds together.","notes_ar":"نموذج للمدرب: راجع الملاءمة وعدّل الأهداف قبل التخصيص. ٦ جولات: دقيقة قوية ودقيقتان خفيفتان (١٨ دقيقة أساسية)، مع ٥–٨ دقائق إحماء و٥ دقائق تهدئة. للمتمرّنين ذوي قاعدة لياقة مناسبة؛ يمكن بدء ٤ جولات وفق المدرب دون زيادة السرعة والجولات معاً.","plan_type":"cardio","weeks":4,"status":"published","version":1,"versions":[],"origin":"Panda Cardio HQ template · 0.9.15","sessions":[{"name":"05 · Bike Intervals","name_ar":"٠٥ · فواصل الدراجة","day":"Thu","focus":"One controlled interval session weekly for experienced cardio clients.","focus_ar":"جلسة فواصل منضبطة أسبوعياً للمتمرسين في الكارديو.","warmup":[{"exercise_id":"lib_warm_01","prescription":"5–8 min easy","notes":"Use the main-session activity at an easy pace."}],"exercises":[{"exercise_id":"ex_9058639cc046","sets":1,"reps":"As prescribed","rest":0,"load":"","notes":"Complete 6 rounds of 1 min hard / 2 min easy (18 min main block), with 5–8 min easy warm-up and 5 min cool-down. Reserve for clients with an established aerobic base. Begin with 4 rounds if the coach chooses; never progress pace and rounds together.","client_note_ar":"٦ جولات: دقيقة قوية ودقيقتان خفيفتان (١٨ دقيقة أساسية)، مع ٥–٨ دقائق إحماء و٥ دقائق تهدئة. للمتمرّنين ذوي قاعدة لياقة مناسبة؛ يمكن بدء ٤ جولات وفق المدرب دون زيادة السرعة والجولات معاً.","intervals":"6 × 1 min hard / 2 min easy","cardio":{"method":"hiit","intensity":"hiit","duration":"6 × 1 min work","frequency_per_week":1,"speed":"Brisk but controlled; never an all-out sprint","incline_resistance":"Increase only enough to create the prescribed effort","distance_target":"","step_target":"","recovery":"2 min very easy pedalling after each work interval; no hard cardio next day"}}],"cooldown":[{"exercise_id":"lib_cool_01","prescription":"5 min easy","notes":"Reduce pace gradually; follow the coach’s assigned recovery."}]}]}]$panda0915$::jsonb)
